-------------------------------------------------------------\
DATA-SPECIFIC INFORMATION FOR: cleaned_data.csv\
-------------------------------------------------------------\
Number of rows: 193 (one per plot per month; April, May, June 2024). Number of variables: 28.\
\
site: Study site (Ed King, Dixon, Ellis N, Ellis S, Nanat, Taylor).\
plot_id: Unique plot identifier within a site (12 per site: 6 caged, 6 open). [caged(c)/uncaged(u)-large gravel(l)/small gravel(s)-replicate#] \
date: Date of the monitoring survey (YYYY-MM-DD).\
month: Monitoring month (April, May, June).\
treatment: Grazer exclusion treatment (caged or open).\
gravel_size: Green gravel size treatment (small = 2 cm diameter; large = 6 cm diameter).\
plot: Gravel treatment combination code of the plot within a site (6 levels). Plot ID without treatment.\
percent_occuring_algae: Percent cover of naturally occurring (non-outplanted) algae in the plot (0 to 100).\
n_kelp_gravel: Number of gravels in the plot with live outplanted kelp at the survey.\
n_gravel: Total number of gravels remaining in the plot at the survey (about 100 were deployed).\
kelp_survival: Percent of remaining gravels with live kelp in the plot (n_kelp_gravel / n_gravel x 100; 0 to 100). Response variable for the kelp survival models (modeled as counts of successes and failures).\
kelp_growth: Total length of kelp measured in the plot at the survey (sum of kelp_total1 to kelp_total5 in the monitoring file; units [cm]). Used as a proxy for net growth; NA when no live kelp was present in the plot. Response variable for the kelp length models.\
urchin_density: Urchin density within the plot (red + green + purple urchins; individuals per m2, standardized by plot surface area).\
grazer_density: Density of all grazers within the plot (urchins + red turban snails + abalone; individuals per m2).\
ts_density: Red turban snail density within the plot (individuals per m2).\
urchin_site_density: Site-level urchin density (individuals per m2) from the transect surveys, for the same site and month.\
grazers_site_density: Site-level density of all grazers (urchins + red turban snails + abalone; individuals per m2) from the transect surveys.\
ts_site_density: Site-level red turban snail density (individuals per m2) from the transect surveys.\
mean_depth_m: Mean depth (m) of the site transect surveys.\
mean_temperature_c: Mean bottom temperature (degrees C) at the site over the monitoring interval before the survey.\
max_temperature_c: Maximum bottom temperature (degrees C) recorded at the site over the monitoring interval. NA where no logger data are available.\
mean_light_lux: Mean bottom light intensity (lux) at the site over the monitoring interval. NA where no logger data are available.\
mean_current: Mean current speed (m/s) at the site over the monitoring interval. NA where no data are available.\
max_current: Maximum current speed (m/s) at the site over the monitoring interval. NA where no data are available.\
bottom_temp: Bottom water temperature (degrees C) from the YSI ProDSS cast at the survey.\
bottom_do: Bottom dissolved oxygen from the YSI cast [ppm].\
bottom_salinity: Bottom salinity (PSU) from the YSI cast.\
bottom_ph: Bottom pH from the YSI cast. NA where not measured.\
\
