DATA-SPECIFIC INFORMATION FOR: cleaned_green_gravel_monitoring_Aug.csv\
-------------------------------------------------------------\
Number of rows: 265. Same variables as cleaned_green_gravel_monitoring.csv (below), but includes the August 2024 surveys (month = March, April, May, June, August as present). In August many plots had been damaged or displaced by storm swell and very few kelp survived, so surveys were incomplete.\
