DATA-SPECIFIC INFORMATION FOR: cleaned_green_gravel_monitoring.csv\
-------------------------------------------------------------\
Number of rows: 193 (April, May, June 2024; six study sites). Variables:\
\
site: Study site.\
plot_id: Unique plot identifier within a site.\
date: Date of the survey (YYYY-MM-DD).\
observer: Initials or name of the diver who recorded the survey.\
n_kelp_gravel: Number of gravels in the plot with live kelp.\
n_gravel: Total number of gravels remaining in the plot.\
n_migrated_holdfasts: Number of kelp holdfasts that had migrated from the gravel onto native substrate. NA where not recorded.\
kelp_total1 to kelp_total5: Total length (units [cm]) of the longest kelp individual on each of up to five randomly selected gravels in the plot (gravels 1 to 5). If fewer than five gravels had kelp, individuals from the same gravel were measured up to a total of five. Recorded as 0 where no kelp was present.\
percent_occuring_algae: Percent cover of naturally occurring algae in the plot.\
n_ru, n_gu, n_pu: Number of red, green and purple urchins counted on the plot floor.\
n_ru_side, n_pu_side: Number of red and purple urchins counted on the cage walls (sides) of the plot. NA where none were recorded or the plot was open.\
n_gu_side: Number of green urchins on cage walls (all NA; none recorded).\
n_ts: Number of red turban snails counted in the plot.\
n_ab: Number of northern abalone counted in the plot.\
n_pyc: Number of Pycnopodia counted in the plot.\
n_cuc: Number of sea cucumberscounted in the plot.\
other_spp: Free text list of other species observed in the plot.\
notes: Free text field notes (e.g. cage condition, damage, displaced gravel).\
ka_length1 to ka_length3, kb_length1 to kb_length2, kc_length1 to kc_length2: Individual lengths (units [cm]) of kelp measured on gravels a, b and c in the plot (up to three individuals per gravel); mostly NA.\
month: Monitoring month.\
treatment: Caged or open.\
gravel_size: Small or large.\
plot: Treatment combination code of the plot within a site. [caged(c)/uncaged(u)-large gravel(l)/small gravel(s)-replicate#]\
kelp_survival: Percent of gravels with live kelp (n_kelp_gravel / n_gravel x 100).\
total_urchins: Total number of urchins in the plot (n_ru + n_gu + n_pu + side counts).\
urchin_density: total_urchins per m2 of plot area (4.5 m2 caged, 1 m2 open).\
total_ts: Total red turban snails in the plot (= n_ts).\
ts_density: total_ts per m2 of plot area.\
total_grazers: Total grazers in the plot (total_urchins + total_ts).\
grazer_density: total_grazers per m2 of plot area.\
kelp_growth: Sum of kelp_total1 to kelp_total5 for the plot (total kelp length, proxy for net growth); NA where no live kelp.\
